WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.400
At the print fair, Ink has 17 lunches
and Fold has 18. There are 35 lunches.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:07.000
Six people move from Fold to Ink.
The packed lunches stay on their trays.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.300
Ink now has 23 people. Fold has 12.
Can you send the trays as packed?

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:14.900
Move six lunches from Fold to Ink.

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:18.000
Ink gets 23 lunches and Fold gets 12.
Each person gets one of the 35 lunches.
